    {
      "name": "Session summary: Built AI chatbot for Soft Standards hero section (notch-version). Key decisions: Us",
      "type": "decision",
      "properties": {
        "decision_id": "4c76b1b8-ba89-4e3b-9239-3844230faffd",
        "project": "notch-version",
        "context": "Session summary: Built AI chatbot for Soft Standards hero section (notch-version)",
        "reasoning": "",
        "full_decision": "Session summary: Built AI chatbot for Soft Standards hero section (notch-version). Key decisions: Used Vercel AI SDK v4 (@ai-sdk/react useChat with sendMessage + parts API, NOT ai/react which no longer exists). Used @ai-sdk/anthropic with claude-sonnet-4-5. API route uses convertToModelMessages + toUIMessageStreamResponse for the new UIMessage format. Replaced form element with div + onKeyDown to fix React 19 + AnimatePresence form submission bug causing page refresh. System prompt enforces strict 2-part format: 8-word headline + 20-word subtitle separated by blank line. Connected service cards to hero AI chat via custom DOM event \"trigger-ai-chat\". GSAP sparkle vectors on button right edge for teaser effect. Replaced Trellis Studios with Hitchhyke as prospect name."
      },
      "id": "5208991b-e991-47cd-be33-f30a77e326a4",
